### How the generated sections were produced

    # bot-gateway: every package NOT flagged "dev": true in the lockfile,
    # i.e. exactly the tree left after `npm prune --omit=dev`. `license` is the value
    # npm recorded from each package's own package.json.
    cd bot-gateway && npx --yes license-checker --production --json

    # agent-container: for each `name==version` in requirements.lock, read the
    # License-Expression / License / License-classifier field out of THAT EXACT
    # version's core metadata. Two evidence sources, both real metadata:
    #   (a) the locally installed dist, used only when the installed version
