    curl -s "https://pypi.org/pypi/<pkg>/<version>/json"   # find the wheel url
    curl -s "<wheel-url>.metadata"                         # read its METADATA

A licence was never carried over from a different version of the same package,
and never guessed from a package name. Of the 117 rows in §4.1, 28 came from
source (a) and 89 from source (b).

